    backlog:hasAuditNote "Reader notes (41, 60 to 140 words each, a slide or chapter link in each) in notes_v3_0_0.py, result sentences for the 18 code slides, deck 03-materials/ch10/SEN0414_Ch10_ReadingWritingFiles_3e_v3_0_0.pptx, manifest chapter_code_ch10_v1_1_0.json, story credits story_images_v3_0_0.json." .
ex:TK_ST10_Deck_10_Verify backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Material check 1.0.2 pass, deck standard 1.1.0 13 of 13, overlap clean, story prose clean, reader-notes check 1.0.0 clean on 41 slides (log 08-tooling/ch10-deck/logs_v3_0_0/reader_notes.log). Slides 9, 24 and 37 were looked at rendered; the others were not. Builder WARN on locations, readmethods, withstatement and shelve (result area slightly under the wanted height). Story repeat check: the UTF-8 story repeats the chapter 8 link and the JSON story shares its people with chapter 7; the owner decides (see the review record)." .
